WEBVTT

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:07.822
Open Settings, Artificial Intelligence, and find the Copilot card.

00:00:07.822 --> 00:00:11.922
It appears when the AI Copilot Orchestrator feature is on.

00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:16.790
Authentication type starts at Not configured, which keeps Copilot off.

00:00:17.244 --> 00:00:21.439
GitHub signed-in user asks for the Client ID and the Client secret of

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:25.299
your GitHub app, and shows the callback address to give GitHub.

00:00:25.299 --> 00:00:28.264
People then use their own Copilot subscription.

00:00:28.714 --> 00:00:33.039
API key, bring your own key, needs no Copilot subscription.

00:00:33.039 --> 00:00:37.630
Choose the Provider type, enter the Base URL and the API key of

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.424
the provider, and the Default model.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:48.216
Wire API format is Chat completions for most models, and Responses for the GPT-5 series.

00:00:48.216 --> 00:00:51.964
Azure OpenAI also asks for an API version.

